Licensing
---------

Two licences apply, to two disjoint parts of this repository:

  lib/libsweepsfile/   MIT           -- see lib/libsweepsfile/LICENSE
  everything else      GPL-3.0-or-later -- see LICENSE

The split is explained in THIRD_PARTY.md. In short: FFTW and the radio
libraries are confined to plugins, so no binary of Sweep++'s links a GPL
component; the GPL is the application's own choice, and libsweepsfile is MIT
because it depends on nothing at all.
